{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","title":"Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning","description":"Bagaimana kegagalan diproses: sebagai data untuk perbaikan atau sebagai bukti identitas luka.","tags":["psychology","learning","trauma"],"custom":{"description":"Bagaimana kegagalan diproses: sebagai data untuk perbaikan atau sebagai bukti identitas luka."},"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"066247b180f935c102f37428ec55f887","updated":1782198659069,"created":1782198659069,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.learning","alias":"learning","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.learning"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.trauma","alias":"trauma","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.trauma"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":11,"offset":1109},"end":{"line":20,"column":58,"offset":1156},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":100,"offset":1557},"end":{"line":22,"column":139,"offset":1596},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":11,"offset":1189},"end":{"line":23,"column":50,"offset":1228},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory"}],"anchors":{"maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning":{"type":"header","text":"Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning","value":"maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"comparison-of-processing-failure":{"type":"header","text":"Comparison of Processing Failure","value":"comparison-of-processing-failure","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"link-to-neurotic-narcissism":{"type":"header","text":"Link to Neurotic Narcissism","value":"link-to-neurotic-narcissism","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning\">Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning-1\">Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#maladaptive-memory-vs-adaptive-learning-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>Pengalaman gagal seharusnya menjadi bahan <em>update</em> perilaku. Namun, pada <em>maladaptive memory</em>, kegagalan tidak menjadi pelajaran, melainkan menjadi bukti identitas.</p>\n<h2 id=\"comparison-of-processing-failure\">Comparison of Processing Failure<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#comparison-of-processing-failure\"></a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Adaptive Learning (Data)</th><th align=\"left\">Maladaptive Memory (Altar Penderitaan)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\"Gue gagal ngomong <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Gue perlu latihan struktur.\"</td><td align=\"left\">\"Gue gagal ngomong <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Gue memang pengecut.\"</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\">\"Gue kalah kredit <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Gue perlu nulis ide sebelum diskusi.\"</td><td align=\"left\">\"Orang lain dapat kredit <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Dunia selalu nyuri dari gue.\"</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\">\"Gue malu <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Gue perlu bangun toleransi rasa malu.\"</td><td align=\"left\">\"Gue malu <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Gue sebaiknya diam saja.\"</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"link-to-neurotic-narcissism\">Link to Neurotic Narcissism<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#link-to-neurotic-narcissism\"></a></h2>\n<p>Pola narsistik neurotik sering terjebak dalam <em>maladaptive memory</em> di mana luka lama membuat ego mengubah kegagalan menjadi narasi pusat: <em>\"Gue yang paling tidak dilihat.\"</em> Jika narasi ini tidak diolah, ia menjadi identitas yang melumpuhkan aksi.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Kegagalan harus menjadi data, bukan menjadi altar penderitaan.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">learning (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">trauma (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting\">Trauma-Informed Learning and Reparenting</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoo